# Route: guide 32 of 53 of the simulator's completionist route for NightElf
# (1445 of 1459 eligible quests, 164.6 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 49 to
# 51, 13 quests, 1.9 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Blasted Lands, Teldrassil): Nethergarde Keep -> Garrison Armory ->
# Serpent's Coil -> Garrison Armory -> Rise of the Defiler -> Nethergarde Keep
# -> Rise of the Defiler -> Nethergarde Keep.
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): The Super Snapper FX (2944;
# Gammerita 48).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Nekrum's Medallion (2991), In Search of Thaelrid (1198),
# Twilight Falls (1199).

